cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Sonar Municipal: semantic search pipeline for Brazilian municipal bills"
abstract: >
  Source code accompanying the ICMC-USP undergraduate thesis
  "Mineração de Dados e Busca Semântica Aplicadas à Análise de Projetos
  de Lei Municipais" (Sonar Municipal project). Implements the data
  collection pipeline from SAPL portals, the dense-retrieval indexing
  with E5 embeddings, BM25 baselines, and the evaluation tooling that
  produced the companion TREC-style benchmark.
